        "created_at": "2019-01-28T12:09:28.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Looks like there's a few different paths to victory here, which is nice- to use character witness or not? Where should the cages go? Heal heroes or focus on damage? Executioners out or kept silent? It makes for a funner game when we compare different strategies.</p>",
