        "created_at": "2019-01-28T15:46:51.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>In my victory, I kept the executioners out, eventually getting all 4 out, and they did the bulk of the damage.</p>\n<p>Just keep the Heroes from having any trials at the start of the environment turn. (Thanks, Kim &amp; Tony!)</p>",
