        "created_at": "2019-02-15T16:35:50.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Nope. Can’t do this one at all.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>I domt understand what what to focus on. I can’t deal enough damage, do I get rid of the ocular swarms? The reapers? Do I care about managing infinities deck or the environments?</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>ive barely put a dent in him.</p>",
